*************************************************************************
* Supervisory file for USA stable population based on rates for year 1933
* Created on 22.08.2025
* Based on code by Liliana Calderon
************************************************************************
** NB: 
* Probabilities of death come from HMD
* Fertility rates come from HFD
************************************************************************
segments  2
input_file presim

marriage_after_childbirth 1 
marriage_eval distribution
marriage_queues 1
hetfert 0
bint 12

************************************************************************
* Pre-simulation (100 years) to get stable population
* Using HMD rates for 1933 and HFC rates for 1933
duration 1200
include rates/USAfert1933
include rates/USAmort1933
run

* Now run for 200 years in order to have full kinship networks
duration 2400
include rates/USAfert1933
include rates/USAmort1933
run
